00:00:49.220 --> 00:00:52.760
I'm sure I will beat Miikka and Emil at the
same time

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:53.900
Not bad!

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:00.860
Not so friendly pass!

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.380
I should have caught that! I'm sorry!

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:27.300
Impressive!

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:48.767
Thanks for watching guys!

00:03:48.767 --> 00:03:50.620
Hope you enjoyed our badminton special episode!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.660
Remember to subscribe to our channel
here

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.300
